{
  "_note": "BL golden bills. Hand-computed minor units (paise), read by domain/billing.test.ts. NOT in goldenExpectedValues.json: that file is generated wholesale by buildMockData7.js, so hand-added rows would vanish on the next rebuild. Rows are input-explicit (lines carry their own snapshot, cfg carries the tax blocks), so nothing here needs a menu seed. Defaults unless a row overrides: food = exclusive 250 + 250 bps, liquor = inclusive parts [], partRounding independent, roundTo 100.",
